        <mxCell id="footer" value="&lt;b&gt;Flow:&lt;/b&gt; blue = user traffic/data · dashed orange = private-app outbound via NAT · dashed purple = alarm action&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scope:&lt;/b&gt; Terraform manages VPC, routing, ALB, EC2, RDS, ECR, SSM parameters, monitoring and S3 website configuration. S3 bucket itself is created outside Terraform in this lab.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Current limits:&lt;/b&gt; S3 website and ALB expose HTTP only; no CloudFront, WAF, ElastiCache, Auto Scaling or SNS email subscription." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F4F7;strokeColor=#D0D5DD;fontColor=#344054;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=22;" vertex="1" parent="1">
